Mechanism:
- bbt-ui/src/components.rs:119 — Edit/Preedit use UTF-16 offsets and reject
  surrogate splits. EditingText shapes independent runs with existing Measure,
  lays out selection/caret/underline using existing Text/Box paints. Marked
  replacement is a preview; committed value and natural field size are retained.
- widgets.rs:536 and modules/launcher.rs:39 — optional edit shares the original
  field box/insets; None takes the old paint path. Wren corrected the generic
  overlay inset and renamed ed-* classes at the source, avoiding selector leaks.
- app launcher.rs:66 — pure selection/caret/composition state. Ordinary key
  inserts are held during composition; only Commit replaces the captured range.
  Preedit never filters or activates; Escape cancels. Existing cap and default
  spawn behavior remain, with Right dive and empty Left/Backspace climb.
- main.rs:280 — focus routing keeps terminal keys on PTY before editor dispatch.
  Winit preedit UTF-8 cursor bytes become UTF-16; IME candidates use the actual
  retained caret rectangle. Pointer edits retain stable hit regions through
  redraw, so successive drag events cannot drop the final selection position.
- scene.rs:554 — query hit tests use current shaping metrics and valid UTF-16
  boundaries. No browser child position feeds native layout.
- capture-inputs.js and book components/widgets/launchers — capture visible
  text, selection, caret pseudo-element and IME underline geometry; register
  four edit states per page across four densities and two themes (64 new cases).
  Invisible empty text spans have no text/baseline diagnostic. Hidden original
  input box and all visible editing marks remain checked.

